ADDENDA <Act No. 20583, Dec. 20, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning the Korea Advanced Center for Vaccine Development)
(1) The Korea Advanced Center for Vaccine Development established under Article 32 of the Civil Act as at the time this Act enters into force (hereinafter referred to as the "former corporation") shall be deemed the Korea Advanced Center for Vaccine Development established under this Act (hereinafter referred to as the "new corporation"). In such cases, the former corporation shall, within 3 months from the enforcement date of this Act, amend its articles of incorporation to meet the requirements under this Act and obtain authorization under the amended provisions of Article 63-2(4).
(2) A former corporation that has obtained authorization from the Commissioner of the Korea Disease Control and Prevention Agency under paragraph (1) shall be deemed dissolved upon the establishment of the new corporation, notwithstanding the provisions of the Civil Act concerning the dissolution and liquidation of corporations, and all business affairs, rights and obligations, and property of the former corporation shall be succeeded by the new corporation.
(3) The value of the property to be succeeded by the new corporation under paragraph (2) shall be based on the book value as of the day immediately preceding the date of registration of the establishment of the new corporation.
(4) The name of the former corporation stated in the registry or other official records as of the time of establishment of the new corporation shall be deemed the name of the new corporation.
(5) The executives and employees of the former corporation at the time of the establishment of the new corporation shall be deemed the executives and employees of the new corporation, and their terms of office shall be calculated from the dates of their original appointments.
(6) Any act performed by or against the former corporation prior to the establishment of the new corporation shall be deemed an act performed by or against the new corporation.

